---
title: Application Config Package
description: bioetl.application.config - Configuration resolution
---
classDiagram
    direction TB

    class ConfigPathResolver {
        +resolve(name) Path
        +resolve_all(pattern) list[Path]
        +get_config_dir() Path
        +exists(name) bool
        -_base_path: Path
        -_extensions: list[str]
    }

    class ConfigRuntimeService {
        +get_runtime_config() RuntimeConfig
        +apply_overrides(config, overrides) Config
        +validate_runtime(config) bool
        +merge_with_defaults(config) Config
        -_defaults: dict
        -_environment: str
    }

    class RuntimeConfig {
        +environment: str
        +debug: bool
        +log_level: str
        +output_dir: Path
        +temp_dir: Path
    }

    ConfigPathResolver ..> RuntimeConfig : resolves
    ConfigRuntimeService --> ConfigPathResolver : uses
    ConfigRuntimeService ..> RuntimeConfig : manages

    note for ConfigPathResolver "Resolves configuration\nfile paths"
    note for ConfigRuntimeService "Manages runtime\nconfiguration state"
